{"id":"n68633-1-7","stage":5,"title":"온전하다 · 完整","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68633-1-7-1","ko":"이번에 비 피해가 아주 심하다고 하던데요?","zh":"听说这次雨灾的破坏非常严重吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"비","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}},{"text":"피해가","meaning":"被害，受害，遇害","explanation":"피해：被害，受害，遇害；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피해","audio":"/audio/eeb61bc5c7fb3a10dc0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85548","senseId":"1","lemma":"피해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피해가","audio":"/audio/d51e2b15df68aa5eb2da.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"심하다고","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심하다고","audio":"/audio/9d975bba3911d75accf8.mp3"}},{"text":"하던데요?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","o