，完好；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"온전하다","audio":"/audio/03ef6f2a5599f6d1ef32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68633","senseId":"1","lemma":"온전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온전하게","audio":"/audio/1f642706f77589c84b7b.mp3"}},{"text":"남아","meaning":"留下","explanation":"남다：留下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"7","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아","audio":"/audio/6ab4b405a40e3c3ced24.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이","audio":"/audio/425fee6379fd1e4146b7.mp3"}},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要。","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"없을","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없을","audio":"/audio/ae6fe725825ab5ec6742.mp3"}},{"text":"정도입니다.","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"ter